{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"65ab6538-18b6-4ad8-bcb5-6b2d072d394d","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":686688,"messageId":686688,"newsId":639305,"title":"Correction: Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - fourth tranche for 2026","body":"Correction: The stock market announcement below is a correction of the\nannouncement published on 17 November 2026 with message ID 686656. The previous\nannouncement inadvertently included historical transactions and should therefore\nbe disregarded in full.\n\nPlease see below information about transactions made under the fourth tranche of\nthe 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR,\nCEUX:EQNRO, TQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 28 October 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 29 October 2026 to no later than 1\nFebruary 2027.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 28 October 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/684948\n\nFrom 9 November to 12 November 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of\n610,000 own shares at an average price of NOK 389.7988 per share.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Date              |Trading     |              |       Daily|                  |\n|                  |venue       |    Aggregated|    weighted|                  |\n|                  |            |  daily volume|     average|       Total daily|\n|                  |            |    (number of| share price| transaction value|\n|                  |            |       shares)|       (NOK)|             (NOK)|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|9 November        |OSE         |       152,000|    388.7035|     59,082,932.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|10 November       |OSE         |       155,000|    379.0090|     58,746,395.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|11 November       |OSE         |       153,000|    392.7580|     60,091,974.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|12 November       |OSE         |       150,000|    399.0397|     59,855,955.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Total for the     |OSE         |              |            |                  |\n|period            |            |       610,000|    389.7988|    237,777,256.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Previously        |OSE         |       974,300|    420.3533|    409,550,172.93|\n|disclosed buy-    +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|backs under the   |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n|tranche           +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |Total       |       974,300|    420.3533|    409,550,172.93|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Total buy-backs   |OSE         |     1,584,300|    408.5889|    647,327,428.93|\n|under the tranche +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|(accumulated)     |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |Total       |     1,584,300|    408.5889|    647,327,428.93|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n\n\nFollowing completion of the above transactions, Equinor ASA owns a total of\n25,180,117 own shares, corresponding to 1.05% of Equinor ASA's share capital,\nincluding shares under Equinor's share savings programme (excluding shares under\nEquinor's share savings programme, Equinor owns a total of 13,875,882 own\nshares, corresponding to 0.58% of the share capital).\n\nThis is information that Equinor ASA is obliged to make public pursuant to the\nEU Market Abuse Regulation and that is subject to the disclosure requirements\npursuant to Section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.\n\nAppendix: An overview of all transactions made under the buy-back tranche that\nhave been carried out during the above-mentioned time period is attached to this\nreport and available at www.newsweb.no.\n\nContact details:\n\nInvestor relations\nBård Glad Pedersen, senior vice president Investor Relations,\n+47 918 01 791\n\nMedia\nSissel Rinde, vice president Media Relations,\n+47 412 60 584\n","category":[{"id":1007,"category_no":"UTSTEDERS MELDEPLIKT VED HANDEL I EGNE AKSJER","category_en":"ACQUISITION OR DISPOSAL OF AN ISSUER'S OWN SHARES"}],"markets":["XOSL"],"issuerId":1309,"